{"availability":"available","full":"himanshu-nakrani/sourceful","name":"sourceful","description":"Self-hostable document Q&A (RAG): Next.js + FastAPI, BYOK OpenAI/Gemini, cited streaming chat, background ingestion, workspaces/RBAC, PostgreSQL+pgvector.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":6,"forks":0,"created":"2025-06-28T21:19:30Z","updated":"2026-10-09T15:28:27Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://sourceful.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://sourceful.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T15:39:19.605Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T15:39:19.605Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T15:39:19.605Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T15:39:19.605Z","stars":6,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["[](LICENSE) [](.github/workflows/ci.yml) []( []( []( []( [](","Self-hostable, production-oriented RAG — upload documents, ask natural-language questions, and receive streaming, cited answers using your own OpenAI or Google Gemini API keys.","The repository evolved from a Streamlit prototype (legacy/) into a split-stack product: a Next.js 16 dashboard for upload/chat/notebook UX, and a FastAPI backend with a durable background worker for ingestion. The design optimizes for self-hosting (BYOK, no mandatory SaaS), operational visibility (jobs, metrics, readiness), and incremental RAG sophistication (hybrid search, reranking, GraphRAG, agentic retrieval) behind feature flags."],"features":["Document upload — multipart POST /api/ingest with checksum deduplication per owner + provider + embedding model.","Job tracking — stages: queued → extracting → chunking → embedding → storing → ready (or error with retries).","Grounded chat — JSON (POST /api/chat) or SSE streaming (POST /api/chat/stream) with Citation objects (chunk id, score, page, excerpt).","Conversations — persisted threads per document; export as Markdown/JSON.","Analysis modes — ask (default), compare, extract, brief via ChatRequest.mode (backend/models.py)."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/himanshu-nakrani/sourceful/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"284d2ef86e3c22251fd9ee9fb1d3250bbfec6142511b8733b43ae46adf99a414","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T15:39:19.747Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T15:39:19.747Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"[](LICENSE) [](.github/workflows/ci.yml) []( []( []( []( [](","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/himanshu-nakrani/sourceful/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"optional","text":"User accounts — email/password signup, session cookies + Bearer tokens, optional Google OAuth (backend/routers/auth.py).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/himanshu-nakrani/sourceful/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"284d2ef86e3c22251fd9ee9fb1d3250bbfec6142511b8733b43ae46adf99a414","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/himanshu-nakrani/sourceful/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T15:39:19.748Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T15:28:27Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/himanshu-nakrani/sourceful/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T15:39:19.749Z","hash":"284d2ef86e3c22251fd9ee9fb1d3250bbfec6142511b8733b43ae46adf99a414","originalBytes":41161,"storedBytes":41161,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["api","backend","get","chat","workspaces","post","document","documents","worker","auth","retrieval","workspace","session","url","rag","run","default","jobs","optional","app","openai","description","job","key","npm","path","provider","upload","frontend","ingest","json","next.js","password","services","build","conversations","sources","bash","eval","owner","pgvector","pytest","routers","tests","agent","chunks","lint","production","sqlite","chunk","fastapi","google","graph","list","public","ready","request","schema","superuser","user","admin","browser","code","database","dev","export","file","gemini","hybrid","message","method","notebook","p